WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:13.630
I see. A place that allows for the destruction of surrounding areas with little consequence.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.200
I guess so.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.580
What are you daydreaming for?

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.900
If you keep your head up, the enemy will spot you.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.490
Yeah, sorry.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.130
That's not good.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.010
Those are Magic Knights of Runa.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:46.600
Just when I thought he had settled down, he pulls an outrageous stunt like this.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.650
That child of a lowborn cur seeks to make a mockery of us!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:53.330
His Majesty's really gone all-out!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:58.930
Yeah. From rear admiral all the way up to field marshal, he went up several ranks!

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.740
Why make me a field marshal?!

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.390
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:15.210
You think we'd jump for joy over promotions that you dictated?

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.910
I am well aware of our rudeness, but...

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:23.480
...I find it somewhat imprudent to take such measures in our current situation.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:28.720
Indeed, it could be taken as an act of provocation by the nobles of the anti-king faction.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.800
With a tone of, "If you don't like it, bring it on!"

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.910
I'm at a loss.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:38.230
Complaining despite being promoted? You lot have such little ambition.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.740
What are you implying?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.350
We are not at Your Majesty's side for successful careers,

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:48.050
but because we are inspired by the way Your Majesty puts this country first,

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:50.330
and we wish to be of aid to you!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.040
Then, Lord Gnubul.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.790
If I were to say that this edict came from putting this country first,

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.170
you would be willing to accept it?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.170
Well...

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.220
You all know of the country called Gastark, do you not?

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.580
I don't know many details,

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.330
but they're a small country on the northern tip of the continent, right?

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.690
Then, I trust you know of the country of Stohl?

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.680
Of course.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:19.020
They're a very prominent, major kingdom of the Menoris Continent.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:25.280
Stohl has roughly five times our national and military might.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.700
According to information that has come to my attention,

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.500
two-thirds of their territory has come under occupation by Gastark.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.520
Unbelievable.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:39.380
How could a great kingdom like Stohl be invaded so easily?

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.260
It doesn't end with Stohl.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.050
Many other smaller kingdoms have been swallowed up by them.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:49.260
Frankly, we can't get accurate figures. It's rather far away, after all.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.810
Indeed it is.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.440
We are strongly geographically separated from Gastark.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.900
For them to become a threat to our country...

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:00.900
Yes, Gastark may not come to us.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.360
But it is fairly likely that other kingdoms feeling the pressure of Gastark

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.160
will seek to increase their own national and military might.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.650
They'll start fighting in droves.

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:11.660
Am I wrong?

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:14.830
We're running out of time.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:23.770
We have no more time to continue this unsightly infighting in our own country.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.550
With that in mind, Froaude offered a proposition.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.410
A proposition to set a trap for the nobles who oppose me,

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:33.060
and purge them all in one fell swoop.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.560
Purge?!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.120
Women, children, everyone?

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:43.900
Sion! If you did that, you'd be no different from the old piece-of-shit king!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.370
No, Claugh.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.280
Froaude's proposition is not wrong.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:52.650
I consider it to be one valid option.

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:54.470
However...

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.540
...I am the king of all living beings in this country.

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:04.460
Even the nobles who wish to kill me are still Roland citizens.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:08.680
Ergo, I believe they must be protected.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:11.930
I wish to save their lives, even if only a few of them.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.930
I wish to unify this country, without killing anyone.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:22.440
That is the reason I have carried out this aggressive measure.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.150
If the nobles seek to join my camp,

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.660
I shall accept them.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:34.730
I would like to work alongside them to make Roland into an even greater country.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.370
But if they insist on opposing me...

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.290
...I will resort to a purge if I must.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.290
I'll say it once more. We have no time.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.520
I cannot allow this country to be destroyed.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:51.810
Would you be willing to work alongside me, to save this country?

00:06:57.760 --> 00:07:00.890
Let all be as my king decrees it.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:10.180
Let all be as my king decrees it.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.870
Feed the nobles sweet honey.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.550
When they lower their guard, purge them all in one clean sweep.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:30.090
I expected you to ultimately choose my plan, but...

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:35.260
You wish to save as many people as you can, even if only a few?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.640
Yes, I suppose kings should be this way.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.970
Do you already realize it?

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:47.370
No, perhaps you seek to walk the right path even after realising it.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.950
But, Your Majesty...

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.150
...the path you have chosen

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.500
will lead to far more bloodshed than the one I showed you.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.510
And you are plagued with worry.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:08:00.370
With that being the case,

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:04.960
I must work to lighten those worries, even if only a little.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.950
Let all be as my king decrees it.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:28.270
Major Miller has a grim expression yet again today, I see.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.280
I guess he's mad because we failed our mission.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.170
It was impossible, Captain.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:38.450
Our failure this time was hardly our fault.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.520
Our opponent this time was just too tough.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:45.330
He used far greater magic than yours, Captain Milk. It was unbelievable.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:50.450
That strength is absurd! He even sent out a red dragon!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:55.920
Yeah, that was scary. I wonder what's going on there now?

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:59.390
It might have turned into one heck of a tourist attraction.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.840
They're probably selling red dragon buns and other made-up souvenirs.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:06.440
That doesn't sound very appetizing.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.940
But if we get pulled off the mission now, what will we do?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.390
We can worry about that if it comes up.

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:18.450
The practical issue is that the taboo breaker was out of our league this time.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:19.530
No way!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.220
I'm gonna save Ryner, mark my words!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:25.040
I'm gonna save him, I will!

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:30.640
You're as spirited as always, Lieutenant Callaud.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:34.120
Y-Yes, sir! Major Miller, you also seem in good spirits.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.960
Then, you're saying

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:39.260
the practical issue is just that this taboo breaker is out of your league?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.940
No, sir. This mission should be a cinch!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.420
H-Hey, Captain, we can't!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.360
Getting off this mission would be better...

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.570
I just wasn't being serious enough before!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:53.650
When I get serious, I can trounce a Ryner or two, no problem!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.330
Can't I, Luke?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.480
E-Er, well, maybe, but...

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:03.490
I see. If Luke speaks that strongly, I'm sure you'll do fine.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.290
Huh? Er, no, uhm...

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.680
All right.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:11.830
I'll continue to entrust this mission to Milk Callaud's taboo breaker pursuit squadron.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.990
Sir! I'll give it everything I've got!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:21.970
An opponent out of our league, hm?

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:27.110
This man, Ryner Lute, is much more troublesome than I had expected.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.980
But beyond that... It looks like Sir Sion is finally starting.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.100
Yeah, so it seems.

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:37.440
This country won't hold out much longer without chasing out the corrupt nobility.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.770
Anything would do at this point, even a purge.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:43.490
What's wrong, Luke? Have you grown to hate the nobility even more than before?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:49.280
Yes. When I think of the way Captain Milk was treated by House Callaud...

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.880
She was taken in from an orphanage, wasn't she?

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:56.250
I hear that House Callaud sought to demonstrate their influence among the military,

00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:00.470
and that Lieutenant Milk was also given rigorous training.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.260
Yes.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:08.770
I don't think Captain Milk has ever enjoyed simple happiness before this.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:12.690
Right now, Milk Callaud must not remain in this country.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.690
I understand.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.220
After all, we mustn't allow Captain Milk to get involved

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.190
in the turmoil that's about to start growing.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.730
Who's doing the cooking today?

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.150
Just have Moe do it.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.940
It's always me that does it!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.750
<i>Ryner.</i>

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:35.750
<i>Wherever you are, mark my words. I'm coming to save you, okay?</i>

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:47.930
Come now, hurry up and go on a rampage, little devil!

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:51.850
H-Hey, is it really safe to encourage a rampage like this?

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.030
I don't know. That's what this experiment's to find out, right?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.440
Hmph, you leave me no choice.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:04.400
Oh, the devil is squirming. Does it hurt?

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.160
Then why don't you beg me?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:10.910
Oh, great Saint Chezo Kalti, please save this accursed devil!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:19.020
How dull. Hurry up and rampage!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.930
How long has he been like this?

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:22.550
Calm down.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.380
Even if we were to leap out now, we wouldn't be able to save him.

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:31.270
We're up against Magic Knights. We'll need to form a plan first.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:39.980
You won't go on a rampage from only personal injuries to yourself?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.990
M-Mom...

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:14.650
Mom... Mom! Mom!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:16.200
Mom!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.020
Ryner!
Mom!

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:27.020
Your mother is dead because she gave birth to a devil!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:31.110
That means your father has committed the same offense!

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:37.790
Arua...

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.800
Dad! Mom was... Mom was, because of me...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.890
It's not because of you.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:47.930
It's them. They killed her.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.600
Arua, this isn't because of you in the least.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:57.360
So... You can't let them have what they want!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:13:59.860
Dad!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:03.110
Don't let it bother you if I get killed.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.820
You have to live...

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:10.710
We'll let the brat live. At least until he breaks and we're done using him!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.910
Attack! We're under enemy attack!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:19.370
I offer up this contract, to bear the wicked spirit beast which sleeps in the earth!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.030
After him!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.930
Don't get any closer.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.330
I will warn you.

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:34.520
The one running around is a wild beast who attacks men and women indiscriminately.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:45.400
What are you doing? Hurry up and get him!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:53.830
I offer up this contract, to unleash the magic beast which dances through the skies!

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.550
I implore our God who dwells in Heaven!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.800
To give Thy pitiful servants the light to destroy demons!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.960
Outta the way!

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:46.130
Calm yourself, you fool!

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.810
An Alpha Stigma?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:05.380
It certainly couldn't be a devil calling out to his brethren!

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:14.300
Holy Runa's magic cannot be stolen by one with no faith in God!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.950
I implore our God who dwells in Heaven,

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.620
to give Thy pitiful servants the light to destroy demons!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.910
I implore our God, who dwells in Heaven, to give Thy pitiful servants...

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.250
...the light to destroy demons!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.780
You monster!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.100
You fucker!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.490
Hey, you over there, the kid's dad!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.900
We can't save you by ourselves!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.610
First, beat up those stupid nobles,

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:53.780
then take off the kid's ropes and get the hell out of here!

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:59.390
You'd save someone from a different country?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:00.980
Dad!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.620
Dad...

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:07.130
Arua! I'll save you now!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.460
Dad!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:14.180
I'm going to remove the ropes now, okay?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.180
The light to destroy demons!

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:25.600
<i>I can do this.</i>

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.860
<i>Together with her, I can do this!</i>

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:41.120
<i>Yes, when I'm with her...</i>

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.290
<i>Surely...</i>

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:49.440
I'll be sure to save you...

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.770
See that?

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.940
I delivered divine retribution to one who sought to release a devil!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.370
No!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:22.120
Go, Ryner!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:04.950
Arua.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:06.460
You must be tired.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:14.450
Have a long rest.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.980
Let's go, Ryner.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.580
Hey! That's our research sample!

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:46.010
If you take it, you'll be recognized as a devil,

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:49.400
and you will suffer God's punishment!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.880
Did you say God's punishment?

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:58.380
When you do such cruel things and get no punishment at all,

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.320
you say we'd get divine retribution just because of those eyes?!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.300
Ryner!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.810
Enemy reinforcements are on the way. Let's hurry.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.560
Damn it!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:26.360
<i>Damn it, damn it, damn it!</i>

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:28.730
<i>What the hell is wrong with you people?!</i>

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.750
<i>You'd give us divine retribution?</i>

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.080
<i>If so, then why did you even make us?!</i>

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.060
If there is a God, I dare you to answer me!

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:50.680
Why did you make someone like me?

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:55.900
To toy with me for your amusement, then deliver divine punishment?

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.930
What a load of crap.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:04.130
I'm not... We're not your toys!

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:08.200
We're alive too, you know.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:15.760
It's not like we wanted to be born as these devils... as monsters.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:18.430
It's not like.. It's not like...

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:22.220
It's not like we want these eyes, either!

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:26.850
Or maybe it is our fault?

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:32.520
If there really is a God in this land...

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:37.860
...please, I beg of you, tell me.

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:25.370
<i>Roland's a real pain of a country.</i>

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:28.490
<i>Doesn't Sion work way too hard?</i>

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:30.090
<i>Forget about the nobility or whatever,</i>

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:33.220
<i>just kick back for a little while and relax!</i>

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:34.880
<i>Seriously, yeesh.</i>
